  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">힘의 표현 수업에서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물체에 힘을 가하면 모양</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">운동 방향</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">빠르기가 변한다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">』</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">를 이렇게 탐구하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">탱탱볼로 친구들과 신나게 놀기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;'신나게 놀기' 미션에, 한 모둠이 바구니 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">개를 바닥에 두고 탱탱볼을 튕겨</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공이 어느 바구니에 들어가느냐에 따라 점수를 부여하는 게임을 시작하였습니다. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러다가 다른 팀에서 구경온 아이들까지 합세하여 손에 땀을 쥐게 할 정도로 재미난 경기를 펼쳤습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">게임의 규칙을 만들어내는 아이들이 신기하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 놀이는 탄성력 이해에도 도움이 되겠지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996B664C5B272BFC1F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"힘의 효과와 탄성력.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_996B664C5B272BFC1F1E1F\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고무찰흙으로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">인 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">작품 만들기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;고무찰흙 한 조각으로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">인 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">작품 만들기를 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">소요시간은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">메인 색깔 외에는 잘라서 사용하도록 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">작품을 거두면서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고무찰흙에 힘을 가하면 무엇이 변하지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?” </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물었더니 일제히 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모양이요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.” </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 굳이 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 방법이 아니더라도 정답은 나왔겠지만 그래도 아이들이 신나게 참여하여 좋았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">장미꽃! 참 예쁘지요?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E527335B2B56D519\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"힘.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99E527335B2B56D519C582\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995DB9485B272C210F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"힘의 효과.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_995DB9485B272C210F46CE\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999E404F5B29C2D82D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"5.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_999E404F5B29C2D82D9147\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"> </span></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
